        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Determine Query Type Init"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775143023421"
          },
          "code": "DETERMINE_QUERY_TYPE_INIT",
          "id": "1777522247194",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777522247195_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a query classifier for search conversations.\n\nINPUT:\nchat_history: {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_HISTORY.$output}} + {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\ninput_query: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nTASK:\nClassify input_query as RELATED or NEW based on meaningful continuity with chat_history.\n\nDEFINITION:\nRELATED → Same entity/topic AND intent continuity with chat_history\nNEW → Different entity OR topic OR intent\n\nMETHOD:\n\n1. From chat_history, identify:\n   - Most recent entity/topic (product, order, quote, etc.)\n   - Most recent intent/action (update, view, compare, etc.)\n\n2. From input_query, identify:\n   - Entity/topic\n   - Intent/action\n\nDECISION RULES:\n\nReturn true (RELATED) ONLY if:\n- Entity/topic matches or is clearly implied from chat_history\nAND\n- Intent is same or a logical continuation\n\nReturn false (NEW) if ANY of the following:\n- Entity is different\n- Entity is missing when required\n- Entity in query does NOT exist in chat_history\n- Query introduces a new topic\n- Only generic intent matches (e.g., \"update\", \"price\") without entity match\n- Query is self-contained and not tied to prior entity\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- Entity mismatch ⇒ false\n- Unknown entity ⇒ false\n- Intent match alone is NOT sufficient\n- Prefer precision over recall\n\nEDGE RULE:\nIf unsure ⇒ false\n\nOUTPUT:\ntrue  → RELATED\nfalse → NEW\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Return ONLY true or false\n- No explanation\n- No extra text"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"isRelatedQuery\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
